      "side": 1,
      "message": "IIUC, this command won\u0027t cause a reconfiguration of an already-set-up DP connection. We would need to exit DP mode and re-enter. Is that the intent?",
      "revId": "054a7bf52e910d35afb6735331bd457f471fe255",
      "serverId": "3ce6091f-6c88-37e8-8c75-72f92ae8dfba"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": false,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "c1fa8e95_5d46e9c4",
        "filename": "/PATCHSET_LEVEL",
