        "id": 1305927
      },
      "writtenOn": "2021-06-08T22:15:47Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I\u0027m OK with the current scope. I just wanted to make sure I wasn\u0027t missing something.",
      "parentUuid": "c1fa8e95_5d46e9c4",
      "revId": "054a7bf52e910d35afb6735331bd457f471fe255",
      "serverId": "3ce6091f-6c88-37e8-8c75-72f92ae8dfba"
    },
